flowchart TB
  accTitle: Lazygit 0.65.0 panels and common bindings
  accDescr: Keys 1 through 5 focus status, files, branches, commits, and stash. Space toggles staging, C and V copy and paste commits, and stashes use Space to apply or g to pop. z undoes and Z redoes.
  subgraph working["Inspect working tree changes"]
    direction LR
    files["2 · Files<br/>Space stages / unstages<br/>c commits · A amends"]
    diff["Diff preview<br/>Inspect added and removed lines<br/>Use Space to stage a hunk in the diff"]
    files -->|"Enter to view diff"| diff
  end
  subgraph history["Manage repository history"]
    direction LR
    branches["3 · Branches<br/>Space checks out · n creates<br/>M merges · r rebases"]
    commits["4 · Commits<br/>i rebases the current branch<br/>C copies · V cherry-picks"]
    stash["5 · Stash<br/>Space applies · g pops<br/>d drops"]
    branches ~~~ commits ~~~ stash
  end
  subgraph global["Global controls"]
    direction LR
    navigation["Panels and navigation<br/>1 status; 2–5 other panels<br/>Tab switches · j / k moves"]
    undo["Undo supported Git operations<br/>z undo · Z redo<br/>Not a backup of uncommitted files"]
    session["Session controls<br/>R to refresh<br/>q to quit"]
    navigation ~~~ undo ~~~ session
  end
  working ~~~ history ~~~ global
